  "message_id": "MSG_000",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}＞玲正捂着肚子……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e822_500.bf.json:1:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_001",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 29 01 07 01 02 01 04 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 A3 10}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 04 01}呜呜，肚子……好饿……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e822_500.bf.json:1:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_001",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 29 01 0D 01 02 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 6D 10}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 05 01}……嗯？\n这是什么？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e822_500.bf.json:2:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_002",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}＞玲拿起的，\n似乎是一截绳头。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e822_500.bf.json:3:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_003",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0C 01 0B 01 03 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 C8 08}“注连绳”……吗？\n不过，注连绳不是绕在树上的东西吗？\n这里又没有树。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e822_500.bf.json:4:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_004",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 04 01 07 01 02 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 BA 02}说不定是用来拔河的。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e822_500.bf.json:5:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_005",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 29 01 01 01 09 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 07 01}拔河……我知道！\n怎么玩！？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e822_500.bf.json:6:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_006",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 04 01 0D 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}呃……\n两队分别拉住绳子两端，\n被拉过去的一队就输了……吧。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e822_500.bf.json:7:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_007",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 29 01 0B 01 02 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 2D 10}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}用筷子从两头拉金枪鱼！？\n金枪鱼被抢走就算输，\n也就是弱肉强食的游戏！？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e822_500.bf.json:7:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_007",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 29 01 03 01 02 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 08 01}我要……开吃了！！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e822_500.bf.json:8:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_008",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 15 01 03 01 08 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 EC 0D}{F5 C1 02 01 01 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 02 01}玲！等等！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e822_500.bf.json:9:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_009",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 29 01 07 01 02 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 4E 10}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 04 01}诶——！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e822_500.bf.json:10:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_010",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 15 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}不觉得奇怪吗？\n绳子就这样显眼地放在路上……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e822_500.bf.json:10:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_010",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}……理世，风花。\n附近有阴影的气息吗？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e822_500.bf.json:11:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_011",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 07 01 01 01 01 01 F5 02}{F5 86 07 01 0B 01 65 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 29 05}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 07 01}啊……真的有！\n那根绳子上有树形阴影的气息！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e822_500.bf.json:12:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_012",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 07 01 01 01 01 01 F5 02}{F5 86 0F 01 0D 01 65 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 16 0B}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 0B 01}刚、刚才没有注意到……\n绳子的另一头似乎有阴影！\n请小心！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e822_500.bf.json:13:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_013",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 15 01 02 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 A1 0D}果然……\n阴影恐怕是在拟态，\n打算袭击靠近的人。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e822_500.bf.json:13:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_013",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 15 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}不过，它现在还没发现我们。\n此时出手，就能抢占先机。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e822_500.bf.json:13:2",
  "message_id": "MSG_013",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}当然，不想战斗的话，\n也可以不去理会。\n那么，怎么办？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e822_500.bf.json:14:0",
  "message_id": "SEL_014",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F4 87 0E 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 86 01 01 02 01 01 01 01 01}与阴影战斗{F5 47 02 01 01 01 01 01 21 01}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e822_500.bf.json:14:1",
  "message_id": "SEL_014",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}别惊动它{F5 47 02 01 01 01 01 01 21 01}{00}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e822_500.bf.json:15:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_015",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 15 01 07 01 02 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 E2 0D}那么，准备战斗。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e822_500.bf.json:16:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_016",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}＞……！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e822_500.bf.json:17:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_017",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 93 0D}{F5 C1 04 01 01 01 01 01 02 01}明白了。\n那就别管它了。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e822_500.bf.json:18:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_018",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 29 01 07 01 02 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 31 10}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 0A 01}差一点就咬到阴影了……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e822_500.bf.json:19:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_019",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 15 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}幸好赶上了。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e822_500.bf.json:20:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_020",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 29 01 09 01 02 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}善、善……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e822_500.bf.json:20:1",
