  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 79 10}那个……\n谢谢你一直保护我……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e822_500.bf.json:20:2",
  "message_id": "MSG_020",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 20 10}真的……谢谢你。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e822_500.bf.json:21:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_021",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 15 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 6F 0D}……我们不是这样约好的吗。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e822_500.bf.json:22:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_022",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 29 01 07 01 02 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 0B 01}不、不是约定的问题……！\n我不是这个意思……！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e822_500.bf.json:22:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_022",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 59 10}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 04 01}……真是的！\n善是笨蛋！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e822_500.bf.json:23:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_023",
