  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}没有那回事{F5 47 02 01 01 01 01 01 21 01}{00}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e822_500.bf.json:26:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_026",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 29 01 0D 01 02 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}是、是吧！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e822_500.bf.json:27:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_0262",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 29 01 01 01 0B 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 07 01}……也没那么过分啦！\n善……是个好人。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e822_500.bf.json:28:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_027",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 29 01 01 01 0B 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}……嗯，没有那回事。\n善……是个好人。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e822_500.bf.json:29:0",
